1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Every day, AI models generate thousands of responses

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
and some of them are dangerously wrong.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
There's no built-in way to know when AI is confident
and when it's guessing.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Guardrail is a confidence scoring engine that sits
between your AI and your users.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It scores every response in under 50 milliseconds —
no LLM calls, no extra tokens burned.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Paste any AI response into the playground.
Guardrail scans for 55 signal patterns.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Clean, confident text gets a green light — DELIVER.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Now watch what happens with hedged medical advice.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Guardrail detects the uncertainty,
the approximate language, the missing citations.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
And escalates it to a human.
No hallucinated dosage reaches your user. Ever.

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Integrate in under five minutes.
A REST API. A browser SDK.

12
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Or a native MCP server for Claude Desktop —
one command: npx guardrail-mcp.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
And in the live chat demo, asking for real-time stock data
triggers an immediate escalation.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Guardrail is free to try — no API key required.
Score your first AI response in ten seconds.

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Because the best AI safety layer
is the one you can ship today.
